{
  "esm": "2.4.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_cgrid_diff_x",
    "description": "The zonal face forward difference on the mom6_cgrid: diff_x(i,j,k) = X(i+1,j,k) - X(i,j,k), the east-neighbor-minus-cell difference of a cell field X [i,j,k] lowered onto the east faces. It is the difference-building block of the finite-volume pressure-gradient force of MOM_PressureForce_FV.F90 PressureForce_FV_Bouss (:1797-1805): the consumer assembles the east-face pressure-difference group dP_x = -diff_x(P_int) + diff_x(h)*intx_pa - diff_x(e_bot)*intx_dpa*Z_to_H from the P_int/h/e_bot cell fields and the intx_pa/intx_dpa east-face interface integrals, keeping the Fortran's exact g1 + (g2f - g2s) grouping (verified bit-exact against the dump), and the face-thickness denominator h_c + h_e of the PFu acceleration from 2*mom6_cgrid_avg_u(h) (exact since the 0.5 factor is a power of two). SOLID-WALL BOUNDARY: the east face at the domain edge (i = N_I) is a wall with a zero-gradient halo (no normal variation of the cell fields through the wall), so the i = N_I region is the EXPLICIT mirror wall diff_x(N_I,j,k) = X(N_I,j,k) - X(N_I,j,k) = 0 — the mirrored neighbor is the cell itself, NOT a clamped read of a nonexistent cell. The rule is a named-op rule (esm-spec 9.6.8), applied once per consumer equation as mom6_cgrid_diff_x(X); X is a param whose shape must be declared [i,j,k] (esm-spec 9.6.1 where clause).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:rule",
      "family:mom6_cgrid",
      "grid:mom6_cgrid",
      "op:diff",
      "order:1",
      "bc:wall",
      "axes:i,j,k"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Adcroft, A., et al. (2019). The GFDL global ocean and sea ice model OM4.0. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 11(10), 3167-3211.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2019MS001726"
      },
      {
        "citation": "MOM6 source: MOM_PressureForce_FV.F90 PressureForce_FV_Bouss g1+g2 at :1797-1805; the east-face convention of the mom6_cgrid grid.esm."
      }
    ]
  },
  "operator_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    }
  ],
  "operators": {
    "mom6_cgrid_diff_x": {
      "params": ["X"],
      "match": {
        "op": "mom6_cgrid_diff_x",
        "args": ["X"]
      },
      "where": {
        "X": {
          "shape": ["i", "j", "k"]
        }
      },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [
            [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
            [1, "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            ["N_I", "N_I"],
            [1, "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["X"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
              "j": [1, "N_J"],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": ["X", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"]
                },
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": ["X", "i", "j", "k"]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          0.0
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
